  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 14px; color: rgb(35, 47, 63); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Campaign Overview: Briefly introduce the product and its unique value. Include key features, target audience, and how it fits into the lifestyle of potential customers. Highlight any ongoing campaigns or collaborations.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 14px; color: rgb(35, 47, 63); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Our target audience is people who are cooking &amp; interested in kitchen organization.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 14px; color: rgb(35, 47, 63); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Campaign Goals: Increase brand awareness for the product(s). Drive traffic to social media platforms and the Green Stand Market website. Foster community engagement through cross-promotion and collaborations.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 14px; color: rgb(35, 47, 63); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Permission to Repost Videos: Can we repost your videos on Facebook, TikTok, and YouTube for cross-promotion? Social Media Engagement: We&rsquo;d love for you to follow our Instagram and Facebook pages. We&rsquo;ll follow you back and engage with your content to support mutual growth.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 0px; color: rgb(35, 47, 63); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">All of these products are focused on being high quality and lasting for years. Many of our competitors have less quality material &amp; we designed everything to last a long time.</p>",
